f","source_start_index":115,"source_text":"又魏惠王十九年，诸侯围我襄陵。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/六、归德府（卷五十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"2諸侯圍魏襄陵。","content_fanyi":"诸侯出兵围攻魏国的襄陵。","content_jianti_auto":"2诸侯围魏襄陵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":146,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d0d-db0e-11ef-b8ba-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"十七年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"十七年","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9cd8-db0e-11ef-977b-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（己巳、前三五二）","year_int":-352},"message":"success","success":true}